{"shortDescription":"UAB \"Valstybės investicinis kapitalas\" hereby informs about the decision adopted by Order No. 1K-289 of the Minister of Finance on 23 September 2026 to abandon previous intentions to transfer the shares of UAB \"Valstybės investicinis kapitalas\" to the National Development Bank (ILTE). It has been d…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["UAB \"Valstybės investicinis kapitalas\" hereby informs about the decision adopted by Order No. 1K-289 of the Minister of Finance on 23 September 2026 to abandon previous intentions to transfer the shares of UAB \"Valstybės investicinis kapitalas\" to the National Development Bank (ILTE). It has been definitively decided to maintain a separate company and assign it unique tasks in investing capital into strategic national projects and the defense sector."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Contact person:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Vaidas Daktariunas"]},{"type":"p","children":["Valstybės investicinis kapitalas UAB, Chief Executive Officer"]},{"type":"p","children":["Phone: +370 656 03356"]},{"type":"p","children":["E-mail",{"type":"b","children":[": "]},{"type":"b","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=5iLweiXuUK2kbiIF0By8qvNjMr8jceyBkMlebLpwl6N2Oh1wE-pO472magygiDFT74M6IXbgbGQS4wox9NDhSSlNMfxO_w-AhhSqtJfcpwhNAh6XO1xGpHcwWMkCcDL_HxHu6WxfXcYZ3enRexS03YHp9Ut4_9DjRqOkwLHQTsqYXn2XAA22bi7cw75_a1krZDiBNbAF1sByOsuJFlmx0I6UQZ9oDc-xYDGVu3CFfALa7QG6zMD0JzmMY8dfEwW6bs5DFZ9ZEz5XJ4l1St6ZvGn_yOMn6CGehdLl0YwaW-bil2k-gSStEYSx4bxdEu3P6mRKbnZKNxKNaCVLYhZlhG7MFEDPAW_z08TKmC66xG1i2rPBFH-5lYHi8HU0Gh3srllioJgP-OQ2AjneS5X-PmMdWQpn_x3qZ-qiooQ2VW7mnXTl1hdx_7wz28QO6xzyfLBGUVw-G79HY5YqLR9hLAf1566SJFYp_UW6uGFFDzfCU5JT9Muenl_rgruQKHrn7T9jDGu9b-pDhJAjjGDki0s8AWMWBnSziOIuDrgUNvOpZCNmMW1u1IbgobbcPuciCQshF1L6qzeFTIXzrZvjUZAq5SASnFMLHq9K8eqWb6Pz6qGQXkxXHSUmTNiG5olarU3ZC0Pa7mA0vCs1oZNjPsDOJ8lDVilHw_C50Cny_1KPY5kd_TvoHiPxQn_jEsIIUP8uwtQdHtioXhOFgwf